# Asymmetry 8 — split deployment where converging is the trap.
# Eleven tiles of board and a high ridge sit between the two players. West is a
# damage fight; east is a displacement fight with no damage in it at all.
#   .  open        #  wall        O  pit        ^  spikes      H  high ground
#   A  Player A deploy slot       B  Player B deploy slot
#   any other letter = an enemy declared by a 'spawn' line below

id: as-08-two-fires
number: 408
name: Two Fires
description: Two separate fights on one board, ten tiles apart. A faces things that hurt; B faces a Grappler and a Stalker that cannot deal a point of damage between them.

spawn h = Husk
spawn l = Lobber
spawn g = Grappler
spawn s = Stalker

roster a: Vanguard, Archer
roster b: Threadcaster, Wardbearer

board:
  .h...H...g.
  h....H.....
  ..O..H..O..
  A.h..^..s.B
  A....H....B
  A....H....B
  .lO^.H.^O..
